@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #35566C
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF5D6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C9AD66
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
skinparam classBorderColor #496C84
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #496C84
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
hide empty members
hide circle
title 热管理三条需求 — 综合用例图
left to right direction
actor "驾驶员" as A0
actor "IVI中控交互系统" as A1
rectangle "热管理逻辑控制服务" {
usecase "执行乘员舱制热" as UC0
usecase "管理自动空调模式" as UC1
usecase "管理风窗除霜与除雾" as UC2
}
A0 -- UC0
A1 -- UC0
note right of UC0
对应需求 3.3.1.2
objective require req3312
end note
A0 -- UC1
A1 -- UC1
note right of UC1
对应需求 3.3.1.6
objective require req3316
end note
A0 -- UC2
A1 -- UC2
note right of UC2
对应需求 3.3.1.9
objective require req3319
end note
legend bottom
保留原参与者、3个用例及需求追溯；未新增include/extend。
风窗用例中，后风窗控制细节仍待补充依据。
endlegend

@enduml
